{"v":[{"a":["قُلۡ","أَعُوذُ","بِرَبِّ","ٱلۡفَلَقِ"],"t":"Say, “I take refuge with the Lord of Daybreak","l":"Qul 'A`udhu Birabbi Al-Falaqi","w":[["qul","Say"],["aʿūdhu","I seek refuge"],["birabbi","in (the) Lord"],["l-falaqi","(of) the dawn"]]},{"a":["مِن","شَرِّ","مَا","خَلَقَ"],"t":"From the evil of what He created","l":"Min Sharri Ma Khalaqa","w":[["min","From"],["sharri","(the) evil"],["mā","(of) what"],["khalaqa","He created"]]},{"a":["وَمِن","شَرِّ","غَاسِقٍ","إِذَا","وَقَبَ"],"t":"And from the evil of the darkness as it gathers","l":"Wa Min Sharri Ghasiqin 'Idha Waqaba","w":[["wamin","And from"],["sharri","(the) evil"],["ghāsiqin","(of) darkness"],["idhā","when"],["waqaba","it spreads"]]},{"a":["وَمِن","شَرِّ","ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَٰتِ","فِي","ٱلۡعُقَدِ"],"t":"And from the evil of those who practice sorcery","l":"Wa Min Sharri An-Naffathati Fi Al-`Uqadi","w":[["wamin","And from"],["sharri","(the) evil"],["l-nafāthāti","(of) the blowers"],["fī","in"],["l-ʿuqadi","the knots"]]},{"a":["وَمِن","شَرِّ","حَاسِدٍ","إِذَا","حَسَدَ"],"t":"And from the evil of an envious when he envies.”","l":"Wa Min Sharri Hasidin 'Idha Hasada","w":[["wamin","And from"],["sharri","(the) evil"],["ḥāsidin","(of) an envier"],["idhā","when"],["ḥasada","he envies"]]}]}